.TH MIGRATE_PAGES 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
migrate_pages \- Linux x86-64 syscall 256
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B long migrate_pages(pid_t process, unsigned long maxnode, const unsigned long* from, const unsigned long* to);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrates process pages between NUMA nodes; permissions may be required.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR migrate_pages (2)
